      "review_summary": "The PR reclaims orphaned same-process usage-cost refresh locks and generation-fences queued, scanning, acquisition, and atomic cache-write work across in-process gateway restarts.\n\nPR surface: Source +148, Tests +281. Total +429 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main’s pid-only liveness check cannot distinguish an abandoned self-pid usage refresh lock, so subsequent refreshes remain busy indefinitely.",
